[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460735204","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98904#issuecomment-2460735204","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98904","id":2460735204,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Sq9bk","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T20:40:08Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T20:40:24Z","body":"Does this occur on unencrypted PCKs?\r\n\r\nDoes this occur on an empty project with just a scene too?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460735204/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460741583","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98904#issuecomment-2460741583","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98904","id":2460741583,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Sq-_P","user":{"login":"HKunogi","id":1687701,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc3MDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687701?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi","html_url":"https://github.com/HKunogi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T20:43:46Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T20:55:59Z","body":"> Does this occur on unencrypted PCKs?\r\n> \r\n> Does this occur on an empty project with just a scene too?\r\n\r\nI tested a few times and it seems to not happen with encryption turned off. \r\nBut does happen when using encryption and using the exact same key for the exact same input.\r\nAs an additional note, both files works perfectly fine when loading them on the player by using the same encryption key and the assets can be loaded without any issues, the issue is solely that they generate different hashes which makes update checks by doing hash checks impossible.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460741583/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460766679","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98904#issuecomment-2460766679","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98904","id":2460766679,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SrFHX","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T20:58:53Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T20:58:53Z","body":"The encryption process uses a randomized initialization vector, which is a normal requirement. Not sure what can be done, I guess we can save and reuse IVs for unchanged files as part of the project source.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460766679/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460775288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98904#issuecomment-2460775288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98904","id":2460775288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SrHN4","user":{"login":"HKunogi","id":1687701,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc3MDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687701?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi","html_url":"https://github.com/HKunogi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T21:03:33Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T21:09:45Z","body":"> The encryption process uses a randomized initialization vector, which is a normal requirement. Not sure what can be done, I guess we can save and reuse IVs for unchanged files as part of the project source.\r\n\r\nMaybe they could be saved at export_credentials.cfg file together with the encryption key? Or be given an option to input an specific IV on the command to be used as initial vector and fallback to the random IV only in case nothing was supplied? \r\nIf those aren't sensitive data and can be stored on base project export_presets.cfg together with an identification to detect if the new generated file on given export preset will differ from the old one to whether use the one stored there or make a new one and update it there to make it seamless would be even better.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460775288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460799071","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98904#issuecomment-2460799071","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98904","id":2460799071,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SrNBf","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T21:15:55Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T21:15:55Z","body":"> Or be given an option to input an specific IV on the command to be used as initial vector and fallback to the random IV only in case nothing was supplied?\r\n\r\nIt's one IV per encrypted file in the PCK, so inputting it manually won't work.\r\n\r\n> If those aren't sensitive data\r\n\r\nIt's not, IVs are stored in the PCK itself in plain text.\r\n\r\nSo options are either store them (file hash / IV pairs) during export (in `export_credentials.cfg`, `export_presets.cfg` or a separate file) or add an option to select previously exported PCK and read it from the PCK.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460799071/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460833944","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98904#issuecomment-2460833944","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98904","id":2460833944,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SrViY","user":{"login":"HKunogi","id":1687701,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc3MDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687701?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi","html_url":"https://github.com/HKunogi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T21:37:12Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T21:41:41Z","body":"> > Or be given an option to input an specific IV on the command to be used as initial vector and fallback to the random IV only in case nothing was supplied?\r\n> \r\n> It's one IV per encrypted file in the PCK, so inputting it manually won't work.\r\n> \r\n> > If those aren't sensitive data\r\n> \r\n> It's not, IVs are stored in the PCK itself in plain text.\r\n> \r\n> So options are either store them (file hash / IV pairs) during export (in `export_credentials.cfg`, `export_presets.cfg` or a separate file) or add an option to select previously exported PCK and read it from the PCK.\r\n\r\nWould be possible to have the IV being generated by an RNG algorithm that supports adding an initial seed to it, so in case you provide the same seed it always would generate the same IVs in same order? In case none is provided then a random seed would be generated, this way inputting it would somewhat work.\r\nIn the case of exporting it i believe would be good to have a separate file solely for it, so it won't flood other config files and would be self contained into an specific file for it, easier to handle on the project. In such case the editor would look for that file to read the IV values from, and in case it don't finds it would generate them and save/update the on that file.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460833944/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2461788027","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98904#issuecomment-2461788027","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98904","id":2461788027,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Su-d7","user":{"login":"RedMser","id":5117197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTcxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5117197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-07T09:53:47Z","updated_at":"2024-11-07T09:53:47Z","body":"> IV being generated by an RNG algorithm that supports adding an initial seed \r\n\r\nInserting new files would break then, since you rely on the order. But maybe it could work by using the hash of each file path (+ salt that you can configure)?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2461788027/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2461794842","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98904#issuecomment-2461794842","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98904","id":2461794842,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SvAIa","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-07T09:56:56Z","updated_at":"2024-11-07T09:59:07Z","body":"> Inserting new files would break then, since you rely on the order.\r\n\r\nYes, relaying on order won't work, but it can be seed based on configurable static value and file hash (resetting prng for each file).\r\n\r\n> But maybe it could work by using the hash of each file path (+ salt that you can configure)?\r\n\r\nUsing file path hash is technically not secure (absolutely irrelevant in practice), since it will reuse IV in case of file change and leak some content of the first block if beginning of file is changed.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2461794842/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]